---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Compliance | rea.run"
  description="Short statement: rea.run covers authorized reverse engineering and security research only."
  path="/compliance/"
>
  <article class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-14">
    <p class="badge">Policy</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 text-3xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">Compliance</h1>
    <p class="mt-5">
      rea.run is an independent community guide. Content assumes <strong>legal, authorized</strong> analysis of software you own, build, or have permission to inspect.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not publish piracy, crack, keygen, or DRM-circumvention instructions. Product facts defer to upstream
      <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea">github.com/morluto/rea</a>; we invent no prices or capabilities.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      Not affiliated with morluto, Hex-Rays, NSA/Ghidra, or other “REA” domains.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8">
      Longer FAQ: <a href="/faq/legal-boundary/">Legal use boundary</a>
      · <a href="/faq/">FAQ hub</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
